{"strings":["LPCO","Details related to Licenses, Permits, Certificates or Others.","Document identifier","Identification of a specific document.","Document reference number, assigned by the Government","Document issuing date/time","Date and time the document was issued and when appropriate, signed or otherwise authenticated.","Authentication","Details related to the authentication of a document.","Authentication statement","Statement providing proof that the document has been authenicated.","AuthorizedPerson","Details related to a person designated under relevant legislation for the purpose of issuing official assurances.","Authorised person name","Name of a person designated under relevant legislation for the purpose of issuing official assurances.","Authorized person identifier","Identification of a person designated under relevant legislation for the purpose of issuing official assurances.","International codes (e.g. DUNS, EAN) OR User codes","Role code","Code specifying the role of a party.","UN/EDIFACT code list 3035","AdditionalDocument","Details related to additional documents as part of a declaration or as part of a response.","Additional document identifier","Identification of a document providing additional information.","Additional document type code","Code specifying the type of an additional document.","UN/EDIFACT code list 1001 OR User code list","AdditionalInformation","Details related to the special request from declarant to government to take or not to take action.","In case of using Additional statement code, text or indicator you can make the information more specific by also using Additional statement type.\nIf there are more than 1 occurrences you should always use it in combination with the type.","Additional statement code","Code specifying the form of an additional statement.","User code list","Additional statement description","Description of an additional statement.","Additional statement type code","Code specifying the subject of the additional statement.","StatementTypeCodeList","Consignment","Details related to the transport between a consignor and a consignee as specified in the transport contract document.","Sequence number","Number indicating the position in a sequence.","Total number of packages","Quantity specifying the total number of packages of the entire document (e.g. declaration/consignment).","Consignee","Details related to the party to which goods are consigned.","Consignee name","Name of the party to which goods are consigned.","Consignee identifier","Identification of a party to which goods are consigned.","Address","Details related to an address.","Address type code","Code specifying the type of address.","AddressTypeCodeList","City name","Name of a city.","Country code","Code specifying the name of the country or other geographical entity as specified in ISO 3166 and UN/ECE Rec 3.","CountryCodeList","Country name","Name of the country or other geographical entity.","Transitional element","Country sub-entity identification code","Code specifying the name of a country subdivision.","ISO 3166-2 OR User code list","Country sub-entity name","Name of a country subdivision.","Street and number/P.O. Box","Specification of the postal delivery point such as street and number or post office box.","Not to be used in combination with Street name, House number, House number addition and P.O. Box","Postcode identifier","Identification of the postal zone or address.","ConsignmentItem","Details related to an item in a consignment.","Commodity","Details related to the properties of the goods.","Goods description","Description of the nature of a goods item sufficient to identify it for cross-border regulatory purposes such as customs, phytosanitary, statistical or transport.","Commodity lot identifier","Identification of the production lot by number.","Commodity quantity","Quantity specifying the number of regulated items.","Intended use statement","Statement regarding the intended use of the commodity.","Commodity category code","Code specifying the grouping of similar products into non-commercial categories that are assigned by and useful to regulatory authorities.  More specific than the Goods group name (WCO ID 331) and Goods group name, coded (WCO ID 332).","CommodityCategoryCodeList","Commodity category qualifier code","Code specifying the grouping of similar products identifying categories that are assigned by and useful to the cross-border regulatory authorities.","UN/EDIFACT code list 3055 / User code list (1131)","Intended use code","Code specifying the intended use of the commodity.","IntendedUseCodeList","ApprovedEstablishmentLocation","Details related to a facility approved for a specific purpose by a government authority.","Approved establishment location name identifier","Identification of a facility approved for a specific purpose by a government authority.","UN/LOCODE + User codes OR User codes","Classification","Details related to the non-commercial categorization of a commodity by a standard-setting organization.","Commodity classification identifier","Identification of the non-commercial categorization of a commodity by a standard-setting organization.","Commodity classification type code","Code specifying the commodity classification  (e.g. Harmonized Tariff Schedule (HTS), Export Control Classification Code (ECCC), UNDG Code list, International Code of Zoological Nomenc).","UN/EDIFACT code list 7143","Product","Details related to the tangible article or substance produced by human or mechanical effort or by a natural process.","Product identifier","Identification of an object, for example the unique number affixed by the manufacturer to a product for identification purposes.","Commodity identifier type code","Code specifying the type of commodity identifier.","ProductName","Details related to the name of a product.","Commodity name","Name or term that identifies the goods assigned by a seller as distinct from those of other sellers, in legal terms known as trademark, which helps to identify one item, a family of items, or all items of that seller.","Commodity name qualifier code","Code specifying the commodity name (e.g. common name, registered name, brand name).","UN/EDIFACT code list 7081","ProductCharacteristics","Details related to the characteristics of a product.","Commodity characteristic code","Code specifying the commodity characteristics such as goods grading, genetic modification, quality, etc. that distinguishes the commodity from similar commodities.","Commodity characteristics description","Description of the commodity characteristics (e.g. goods grading, genetic modification, quality, etc.) that distinguishes the commodity from similar commodities.","Temperature","Details related to temperature.","Commodity temperature category code","Code specifying the storage condition of a commodity.","TemperatureCategoryCodeList","Actual temperature","Measure of temperature.","DestinationLocation","Details related to the destination location.","Destination country code","Code specifying the country of destination.","Destination country name","Name of the country of destination.","Destination region identifier","Identification of a country's subdivision of destination.","GoodsMeasure","Details related to goods weight, quantities, and amounts.","Net net weight","Weight of the goods themselves without any packing.","Origin","Details related to the origin of the goods.","Country of origin code","Code specifying the country in which the goods have been produced or manufactured, according to criteria laid down for the application of the Customs tariff or quantitative restrictions, or any measure related to trade.","Country of origin name","Name of the country in which the goods have been produced or manufactured, according to criteria laid down for the application of the Customs tariff or quantitative restrictions, or any measure related to trade.","Region of origin identifier","Identification of the region in which the goods have been produced or manufactured, according to criteria laid down for the purposes of application of the Customs tariff, or quantitative restrictions, or of any other measure related to trade.","Packaging","Details related to packaging.","Number of packages","Quantity specifying the number of individual items packaged in such a way that they cannot be divided without first undoing the packing.","Type of packages identification code","Code specifying the type of package of an item.","PackageTypeCodeList","TransportEquipment","Details related to transport equipment used for the consignment.","Seal","Details related to the seal affixed to a piece of transport equipment, used to secure an object and protect from unauthorized entry or tampering.","Seal identifier","Identification of a seal affixed to a piece of transport equipment by number.","Consignor","Details related to the party which, by contract with a carrier, consigns or sends goods with the carrier, or has them conveyed by him.","Consignor name","Name of the party consigning goods as stipulated in the transport contract by the party ordering transport.","Consignor identifier","Identification of  the party consigning goods as stipulated in the transport contract by the party ordering the transport.","Control","Details related to (governmental) examination.","Certifier","Details related to the party which certifies something.","Certifier name","Name of the party who has provided the certification.","Certifying party identifier","Identification of a party which certifies something.","DepartureTransportMeans","Details related to the goods in the context of export.","Departure means of transport name","Name to identify the means of transport used for the carriage of the goods at the time of departure.","Departure transport means identifier","Identification of the means of transport at the time of departure.","Sea: ITU Standard or Lloyd's number\nAir: IATA aircraft ID\nRoad: national license plate\nRail: locomotive number","Type of means of transport at departure code","Code specifying the type of means of transport used for the carriage of the goods at departure.","TransportMeansTypeCodeList","GoodsConsignedLocation","Details related to the location from where the goods were consigned.","Goods consigned location/country identifier","Identification of the location in country or country from which the goods were initially despatched to the importing country.","UN/LOCODE + User codes OR ISO 3166-1","Warehouse","Details related to the warehouse where a particular goods shipment will be / is / has been stored.","Warehouse departure date/time","Date and time when declared goods were/will be carried out of the designated location.","GovernmentProcedure","Details related to the current and previous government procedure.","Government procedure code","Code specifying a procedure.","UN/EDIFACT code list 7365\nFor Customs:  User codes, categorized based on the revised Kyoto Convention","ExitOffice","Details related to the office of exit.","Exit office identifier","Identification of the location of the regulatory office at which the goods leave or are intended to leave the customs territory of dispatch.","UN/LOCODE + User codes"],"root":{"s":"LPCO","n":0,"d":1,"t":"C","c":"","w":"74B","u":"0001L","q":"1","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/LPCO","src":"BIP LPCO:4","k":[{"s":"identification","n":2,"d":3,"t":"E","c":"0..1","x":"ID","f":"an..70","r":4,"w":"D014","u":"0001L","q":"7","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/identificationIdentifier","ub":["cites","codex","e-phyto","eata","ecoc","etir-carv","oie-cert"],"src":"BIP LPCO:10"},{"s":"issue","n":5,"d":6,"t":"E","c":"0..1","x":"IssueDateTime","f":"an..35","w":"D011","u":"0001L","q":"8","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.org/issueDateTime","ub":["cites","eata","ecoc","ecoo","oie-cert"],"src":"BIP LPCO:11"},{"s":"Authentication","n":7,"d":8,"t":"C","c":"0..*","w":"61B","u":"0045L","q":"20","v":"https://vocabulary.wcoomd.or